# An Aura put onto the battlefield by Show and Tell can attach to a creature but not an artifact that is not a creature (CR 303.4f).

[Bot1 Deck]
Armor of Faith
Show and Tell
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Memnite
Mox Pearl
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Choose(Armor of Faith)
! Bot1.Target(Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Armor of Faith.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
